==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - attributes:
      loading: lazy
  - enclose: <div id="#logo">|</div>
  - height: "310"
  - src: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - width: "310"
==== explainer ====
Output height in integer pixels. Omit one dimension to preserve the aspect ratio; percentages belong in CSS.
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGE>",
  "Enclose": "<div id=\"#logo\">|</div>",
  "ExtraAttributes": {
    "loading": "lazy"
  },
  "Height": 310,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 0,
  "Src": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg",
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 310
}

==== expected output ====
<div id="#logo"><img src="/static/images/cute_cat_aac2716ad97a07c3fe4793ca93c23f03_w310_h310.jpg" width="310" height="310" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
